I removed the enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, and the loader rejects any other import. The approved extension isn't reflected in the grant, so the node can't call `http-client` yet. Once the grant includes it, the import and fetch can be added back. The output is unchanged either way.

